{"seq":2,"slug":"orthopedic-surgery","title":"大学临床医学 — 骨科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/orthopedic-surgery","wordCount":1674,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学临床医学-骨科学\">大学临床医学 — 骨科学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>骨科学研究骨骼、关节、肌肉、韧带和神经等运动系统的损伤与疾病。其临床核心围绕三个主题展开：<strong>骨折</strong>（创伤骨科的基石）、<strong>关节疾病</strong>（退行性和炎症性关节病）和<strong>脊柱疾病</strong>（腰椎间盘突出、脊柱骨折）。骨科疾病的诊断高度依赖影像学——X 线是骨折的首选检查，MRI 是软组织和脊髓评估的金标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"骨折总论\">骨折总论</h3><p>骨折（fracture）是骨的连续性或完整性中断。按病因分为外伤性骨折（暴力所致）、病理性骨折（骨质疏松或肿瘤转移等基础上受轻微外力即断）和疲劳性骨折（反复应力累积）。</p>\n<p>骨折的描述要素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>分类</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开放/闭合</td>\n<td>开放性（Gustilo I-III 型）；闭合性</td>\n<td>开放性骨折有感染风险，需急诊处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>骨折线形态</td>\n<td>横形、斜形、螺旋形、粉碎性、青枝</td>\n<td>影响稳定性和治疗选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移位类型</td>\n<td>成角、侧方移位、短缩、旋转</td>\n<td>需要复位的方向依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部位</td>\n<td>骨干、干骺端、关节内</td>\n<td>关节内骨折要求解剖复位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>骨折愈合经历三个阶段：<strong>血肿机化期</strong>（伤后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 周，血肿被肉芽组织替代）→ <strong>骨痂形成期</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 周，膜内成骨和软骨内成骨形成初始骨痂）→ <strong>骨痂改建期</strong>（数月至数年，按 Wolff 定律沿力线重塑为成熟板层骨）。</p>\n<p>骨折治疗三原则——<strong>复位、固定、功能锻炼</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>复位</strong>：闭合手法复位（适用于多数闭合骨折）或切开复位（关节内骨折、开放性骨折、闭合复位失败）</li>\n<li><strong>固定</strong>：外固定（石膏/夹板/外固定架）或内固定（钢板螺钉、髓内钉、克氏针）</li>\n<li><strong>功能锻炼</strong>：早期开始关节活动和肌肉等长收缩，预防关节僵硬和肌肉萎缩</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"常见骨折\">常见骨折</h3><p><strong>Colles 骨折</strong>（桡骨远端伸展型骨折）：最常见的骨折之一，多见于老年女性摔倒时手掌着地。远端骨折块向背侧和桡侧移位，典型畸形为&quot;餐叉样&quot;（dinner fork deformity）。多数通过闭合复位 + 石膏固定治愈，不稳定型可选择锁定钢板或外固定架。</p>\n<p><strong>股骨颈骨折</strong>：多见于骨质疏松老年人，按 Garden 分型 I-IV 级评估移位程度和股骨头血供损害风险。Garden III-IV 型（完全移位）的股骨头坏死率高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\text{-}40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>，老年患者通常选择人工髋关节置换而非内固定。年轻患者的股骨颈骨折则优先紧急内固定（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\text{-}12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> h 内），以最大限度保留股骨头。</p>\n<p><strong>胫骨平台骨折</strong>：膝关节负重面的关节内骨折，按 Schatzker 分型 I-VI 型。塌陷 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 3\\,\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 或合并韧带损伤时需手术复位内固定，术中需恢复关节面平整度以预防创伤性关节炎。</p>\n<h3 id=\"骨关节炎\">骨关节炎</h3><p>骨关节炎（osteoarthritis, OA）是最常见的关节疾病，核心病理为关节软骨退变和骨赘（骨刺）形成。好发于膝关节和髋关节，危险因素包括年龄、肥胖、关节损伤史和遗传。</p>\n<p>X 线典型表现（Kellgren-Lawrence 分级）：关节间隙狭窄、软骨下骨硬化、骨赘形成、软骨下囊性变。</p>\n<p>治疗阶梯：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[生活方式: 减重 + 运动] --&gt; B[药物: NSAIDs + 局部外用]&#10;    B --&gt; C[关节内注射: 糖皮质激素/透明质酸]&#10;    C --&gt; D[手术: 关节镜清理/截骨矫形]&#10;    D --&gt; E[关节置换: 人工全膝/全髋关节置换]\">graph TD\n    A[生活方式: 减重 + 运动] --&gt; B[药物: NSAIDs + 局部外用]\n    B --&gt; C[关节内注射: 糖皮质激素/透明质酸]\n    C --&gt; D[手术: 关节镜清理/截骨矫形]\n    D --&gt; E[关节置换: 人工全膝/全髋关节置换]</pre><p>人工全膝关节置换术（TKA）在严重 OA（Kellgren-Lawrence III-IV 级）、保守治疗无效时为最终方案。假体使用寿命约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\text{-}20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 年，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上患者术后疼痛显著缓解、功能明显改善。</p>\n<h3 id=\"腰椎间盘突出症\">腰椎间盘突出症</h3><p>腰椎间盘突出症（lumbar disc herniation, LDH）是腰腿痛最常见的原因之一。好发部位为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，因为这两个节段承受最大的轴向负荷和旋转应力。</p>\n<p>突出的髓核压迫相应神经根产生特征性放射痛（坐骨神经痛）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>突出节段</th>\n<th>受压神经根</th>\n<th>感觉异常区域</th>\n<th>肌力减退</th>\n<th>反射改变</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>小腿外侧 + 足背</td>\n<td>踝背伸（足下垂）</td>\n<td>无特异性反射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>小腿后侧 + 足底外侧</td>\n<td>踝跖屈（踮脚无力）</td>\n<td>踝反射减弱/消失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\text{-}90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span> 的患者通过保守治疗（卧床休息、NSAIDs、物理治疗、硬膜外注射）可获改善。手术指征包括：马尾综合征（大小便功能障碍，急诊手术）、进行性肌力下降、保守治疗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\text{-}12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 周无效。标准术式为椎板间开窗髓核摘除术，微创椎间孔镜技术（PELD）在选择性病例中创伤更小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位 75 岁女性跌倒后右髋部疼痛、不能站立，患肢外旋短缩。X 线提示股骨颈骨折 Garden IV 型。请从股骨头血供角度解释为什么不建议内固定，并选择合适的手术方式。</li>\n<li>一位 35 岁男性腰痛伴左下肢放射痛 3 个月，直腿抬高试验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30°</span></span></span></span></span> 阳性，左足不能背伸。请推断突出节段和受压神经根，并制定初始治疗计划。</li>\n<li>对比开放性骨折 Gustilo I 型和 III-B 型在伤口大小、软组织损伤程度和处理优先级上的差异。</li>\n<li>一位膝关节 OA 患者问：&quot;关节镜手术能不能代替关节置换？&quot;你会如何向其解释两种手术的适应证和预期效果差异？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Campbell&#39;s Operative Orthopaedics</strong>：骨科手术学的权威参考，每种术式配有详细图解。</li>\n<li><strong>Rockwood and Green&#39;s Fractures in Adults</strong>：骨折治疗的金标准文献。</li>\n<li><strong>AO Foundation — AO Surgery Reference</strong>（aosurgery.org）：免费在线骨折分类和手术方案数据库，按部位检索。</li>\n<li><strong>Wheeless&#39; Textbook of Orthopaedics</strong>（wheelessonline.com）：免费在线骨科百科，覆盖面广、更新及时。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>骨科疾病的诊治遵循&quot;结构-力学-功能&quot;逻辑链：骨折打断了骨骼的结构连续性，治疗目标是恢复解剖对线并通过固定维持稳定，最终通过功能锻炼恢复运动能力。关节疾病的治疗从保守到手术呈阶梯式递进，关节置换是终末期关节病的有效终极方案。脊柱疾病需要精确的神经定位诊断——症状、体征和影像三者一致时才可确诊。贯穿所有骨科疾病的共同原则是：影像是诊断的眼睛，但治疗决策必须综合患者年龄、功能需求和全身状况。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学临床医学 — 骨科学","id":"大学临床医学-骨科学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"骨折总论","id":"骨折总论"},{"level":3,"text":"常见骨折","id":"常见骨折"},{"level":3,"text":"骨关节炎","id":"骨关节炎"},{"level":3,"text":"腰椎间盘突出症","id":"腰椎间盘突出症"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 外科学总论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/surgical-principles"},"next":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 神经外科","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/neurosurgery"}}